min: min() or max() of an empty list
max: min() or max() of an empty list
pop: pop() from an empty list
index: index(): the value is not in the list
remove: remove(): the value is not in the list
pop 7: pop index out of range
dict pop: key not found
str index: substring not found
center: the fill has to be exactly one character
divmod: integer division by zero
sum: integer overflow in +
